~ start
Danilo: Ano kayang panaginip yun?
Danilo: ...
Danilo: Umuulan nga talaga...
do Hud.show_objectives()
do tutorial.show()
#do Player.looked_window = true
=> END

~ phone_time
do player_danilo.can_move = false
Danilo: Hmmm... ang aga pa pala.
Danilo: ...
do player_danilo.can_move = true
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
do get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout
do add_notification()
=> reminder
=> END

~ reminder
do player_danilo.can_move = false
Danilo: Ngayon pala yung araw na 'yun?
do tension_in_anim()
Danilo : Anniversary na naman ng pagkawala [wave][color=#8B0000][i]niya[/i][/color][/wave].
Danilo: ... [wait = 0.5] ... [wait = 0.5] ... 
do tension_out_anim()
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> go_bed
do player_danilo.can_move = true
=> END

~ go_bed
Danilo: Matutulog na lang ulit ako.
Danilo: May lakad pa mamaya.
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(scene_objectives[2]["ID"], scene_objectives[2]["text"])
do activate_bed()
=> END!

~ water
Danilo: Kailangan ko siguro uminom ng tubig.
do drink_water_anim()
#do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(scene_objectives[1]["ID"], scene_objectives[1]["text"])
#do Player.drank_water = true
do get_tree().create_timer(2).timeout
do Hud.phone_intro()
do Hud.get_node("Control/phone/MarginContainer/lock_screen/Panel/lock").disabled = true
=> phone_time
=> END

